A5. Gemma 4

  The Model is a modified version of Google Gemma 4, which is licensed under the
  Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE-APACHE-2.0 and NOTICE). The portions
  of the Model that constitute Gemma 4 remain subject to that license alone.
  Nothing in these Additional Terms restricts Your rights to Gemma 4 itself,
  which You may obtain from Google directly.

  Modification notice (Section 4(b) of the Apache License): the weight files in
  this distribution were changed by the Licensor. Starting from Google's Gemma 4
  instruction-tuned weights, the Licensor trained a low-rank adaptation of the
  language model's attention and feed-forward projection matrices and merged it
  into those matrices. All other tensors -- including the vision and audio
  encoders, embeddings and normalisation weights -- are unchanged, bit for bit.
  Tokenizer, processor and chat-template files are Google's, unmodified.

  Gemma Prohibited Use Policy. Google's Gemma Prohibited Use Policy
  (https://ai.google.dev/gemma/prohibited_use_policy) states that no one "may
  ... use nor allow others to use Gemma or Model Derivatives" for the uses it
  lists. The Model is a Model Derivative of Gemma 4. You must comply with that
  policy, as updated by Google from time to time, in all use of the Model and
  its Derivatives, and You must pass this obligation on to anyone to whom You
  distribute them. It is incorporated into this license by reference.

